      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B03",
      "act": "FRAMEWORK",
      "narration_text": "RAG adds a step before the answer. Retrieve: search your documents for the few passages that best match the question. Augment: paste those passages into the prompt. Generate: the model writes from that text, and it can say where each part came from.",
