      "beat_id": "B04",
      "act": "MECHANISM",
      "narration_text": "How does the search know which passages match? First, the documents are cut into short chunks. Each chunk is turned into a list of numbers, called an embedding, that captures what it means. The question gets one too. Chunks with similar meaning land close together, so a question about late work can find a passage about an extension.",
