      "act": "WORKED EXAMPLE",
      "narration_text": "Here it is on that same question. The search pulls three passages from the syllabus. The top one says labs can be submitted up to forty-eight hours late, with a ten percent penalty. Now the answer quotes it and names the section it came from, so you can check it yourself.",
